; a<b -> Sa<=b    (a<b := exists c. a+Sc=b ;  Sa<=b := exists c. Sa+c=b)  — order is discrete
(def 0 (all a (all m (= (+ a (s m)) (s (+ a m)))))               ; right-successor (induction on a)
  (natind a (all m (= (+ a (s m)) (s (+ a m))))
    (gen m (refl (s m)))
    (gen a2 (lam ih (all m (= (+ a2 (s m)) (s (+ a2 m))))
      (gen m (eqelim hole (= (+ (s a2) (s m)) (s hole)) (inst ih m) (refl (+ (s a2) (s m)))))))))
(def 1 (all x (all y (-> (= x y) (= y x))))                       ; sym
  (gen x (gen y (lam h (= x y) (eqelim hole (= hole x) h (refl x))))))
(def 2 (all x (all y (all z (-> (= x y) (-> (= y z) (= x z))))))  ; trans
  (gen x (gen y (gen z (lam h1 (= x y) (lam h2 (= y z) (eqelim hole (= x hole) h2 h1)))))))
(all a (all b (-> (ex c (= (+ (s a) c) b)) (ex c (= (+ a (s c)) b)))))
(gen a (gen b (lam h (ex c (= (+ (s a) c) b))
  (unpack h (gen c (lam pf (= (+ (s a) c) b)
    (wit c2 (= (+ a (s c2)) b) c
      (app* (inst* (use 2) (+ a (s c)) (s (+ a c)) b)
            (inst* (use 0) a c)
            (app* (inst* (use 2) (s (+ a c)) (+ (s a) c) b)
                  (refl (+ (s a) c))
                  pf)))))))))
